        "TileImage": "$($repository 3e3e3752-37db-4b0f-8ff3-827d4c565e55).Image",
        "Description": "Sebastian Sato...Prospect of the notorious Chinese crime society known as the Triads. Sato has grown allegiant with the radical, Sinaloa Cartel. \r\rHis plans are to grow ties with Al-Ghazali financial advisors, seeking to obtain funding for the criminal masterminds in chief. According to our intel, we are certain that Sebastian will be attending the Al-Ghazali Grand Opening. \r\rTake care of the subject through any means necessary. He is our top priority.\r\rGood Luck, 47",
